{
 "kind": "workflow",
 "key": "fix",
 "definition": {
  "name": "Le Bureau · corriger les commentaires d'une PR",
  "project_id": "@@kronn.project_id@@",
  "trigger": {
   "type": "Manual"
  },
  "variables": [
   {
    "name": "repo",
    "label": "Dépôt",
    "placeholder": "owner/name",
    "description": "Dépôt de la PR, relu par le bouton de la page.",
    "required": true,
    "source": null,
    "allow_manual_override": false
   },
   {
    "name": "pr",
    "label": "N° de PR",
    "placeholder": "Ex. 2042",
    "description": null,
    "required": true,
    "source": null,
    "allow_manual_override": false,
    "pattern": "\\d+"
   },
   {
    "name": "notes",
    "label": "Consignes",
    "placeholder": "Ex : ignore les remarques de style ; le point sur le cache est prioritaire…",
    "description": "Facultatif : tes priorités ou ce qu'il faut laisser de côté.",
    "required": false,
    "source": null,
    "allow_manual_override": false,
    "control": {
     "type": "textarea"
    }
   }
  ],
  "steps": [
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "prepare",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "Exec"
    },
    "description": "Fils de review non résolus (aucun : fin), copie du dépôt en cache, dossier de travail, dépendances reliées (0 token).",
    "exec_command": "python3",
    "exec_args": [
     "-c",
     "@@script:workflows/pr_update.py@@",
     "fix_prepare",
     "{{repo}}",
     "{{pr}}",
     "{{run.id}}"
    ],
    "exec_timeout_secs": 600,
    "on_result": [
     {
      "contains": "exit_9",
      "action": {
       "type": "Goto",
       "step_name": "end"
      }
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "name": "fix",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "Agent"
    },
    "description": "L'agent corrige les fils actionnables (contrôles verts ou correctif annulé), ajoute les tests, prépare une réponse courte par fil traité et le message de commit, sans rien committer ni pousser (seule étape avec des tokens).",
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "prompt_template": "@@text:tools/fix_prompt.md@@\n\n**CONSIGNES DE L'ÉQUIPE** (en plus des règles ci-dessus, prioritaires sur elles en cas de conflit, jamais sur les consignes de l'auteur) :\n@@fix.guidelines@@\n\nDossier de travail : ~/.cache/pixel-bureau/pr/work/{{run.id}}\nPR : {{repo}}#{{pr}}\n\n{{steps.prepare.data.stdout}}\n\nConsignes de l'auteur (peuvent être vides) :\n<<<CONSIGNES\n{{notes}}\nCONSIGNES>>>",
    "agent_settings": {
     "tier": "reasoning"
    },
    "stall_timeout_secs": 2400,
    "skill_ids": [
     "testing",
     "security"
    ],
    "_skills_from": "fix.skill_ids"
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "check",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "Exec"
    },
    "description": "Contrôles du dépôt sur les fichiers de la PR (ceux de la chaîne, impl.repos.<dépôt>.checks, sauf fix.checks du pack ou github.checks de ta config) ; une commande rouge est relancée sur la PR d'avant les corrections ; verdict en tête de la validation, jamais bloquant (0 token).",
    "exec_command": "python3",
    "exec_args": [
     "-c",
     "@@script:workflows/pr_update.py@@",
     "fix_check",
     "{{repo}}",
     "{{pr}}",
     "{{run.id}}"
    ],
    "exec_timeout_secs": 1800
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "diff",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "Exec"
    },
    "description": "Verdict des contrôles, message de commit, fichiers changés, diff et réponse prévue à chaque fil pour la validation ; rien à pousser : fin (0 token).",
    "exec_command": "python3",
    "exec_args": [
     "-c",
     "@@script:workflows/pr_update.py@@",
     "fix_diff",
     "{{repo}}",
     "{{pr}}",
     "{{run.id}}"
    ],
    "exec_timeout_secs": 120,
    "on_result": [
     {
      "contains": "exit_9",
      "action": {
       "type": "Goto",
       "step_name": "end"
      }
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "gate",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "Gate"
    },
    "description": "Le boss valide le diff et les réponses avant tout push.",
    "gate_message": "🛠 {{repo}}#{{pr}} : corrections des retours de review.\n\n{{steps.diff.data.stdout}}\n\n**Approuver** : commit signé, push protégé, une réponse dans chaque fil traité (résolu s'il est corrigé), bloc « Corrections de review » dans la description de la PR, CI relancée. **Rejeter** ou **Changements** : rien n'est poussé ni posté.",
    "gate_request_changes_target": "abort"
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "push",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "Exec"
    },
    "description": "Validé : commit signé, push protégé, réponses dans les fils (signées : agent et modèle de l'étape fix, version), description de la PR, label de CI reposé, dossier de travail retiré.",
    "exec_command": "python3",
    "exec_args": [
     "-c",
     "@@script:workflows/pr_update.py@@",
     "fix_push",
     "{{repo}}",
     "{{pr}}",
     "{{run.id}}",
     "{{steps.fix.agent}}",
     "{{steps.fix.model}}"
    ],
    "exec_timeout_secs": 300
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "jira_cle",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "Exec"
    },
    "description": "Après le push : le ticket Jira de la PR (clé dans son titre, sinon sa branche). Rien de posté ou pas de clé : code 3, saut à la fin, le run finit réussi. 0 token.",
    "exec_command": "python3",
    "exec_args": [
     "-c",
     "@@script:workflows/pr_update.py@@",
     "fix_jira_cle",
     "{{repo}}",
     "{{pr}}",
     "{{run.id}}"
    ],
    "exec_timeout_secs": 60,
    "on_result": [
     {
      "contains": "exit_3",
      "action": {
       "type": "Goto",
       "step_name": "end"
      }
     }
    ],
    "_requires": "jira.review_version_field"
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "jira_avant",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "ApiCall"
    },
    "description": "La version déjà posée sur le ticket : elle ne redescend jamais (deux PR d'un ticket ont chacune leur compteur).",
    "api_plugin_slug": "mcp-atlassian",
    "api_config_id": "@@jira.config_id@@",
    "api_endpoint_path": "{{steps.jira_cle.data.stdout}}",
    "api_method": "GET",
    "api_query": {
     "fields": "@@jira.review_version_field@@"
    },
    "_requires": "jira.review_version_field"
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "jira_num",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "Exec"
    },
    "description": "Le numéro à poser : le plus grand de cette passe et de celui du ticket.",
    "exec_command": "python3",
    "exec_args": [
     "-c",
     "@@script:workflows/pr_update.py@@",
     "fix_jira_num",
     "{{repo}}",
     "{{pr}}",
     "{{run.id}}"
    ],
    "exec_timeout_secs": 60,
    "exec_stdin": "{{steps.jira_avant.data}}",
    "_requires": "jira.review_version_field"
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "jira_v",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "TransformData"
    },
    "description": "Texte -> nombre typé (value_type number), injecté tel quel dans le PUT.",
    "transform_data": {
     "input_from": "steps.jira_num.data",
     "fields": [
      {
       "target": "v",
       "source": "$.stdout",
       "operation": "copy",
       "value_type": "number"
      }
     ]
    },
    "_requires": "jira.review_version_field"
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "jira_version",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "ApiCall"
    },
    "description": "Le n° de version de la passe dans le champ du ticket (jira.review_version_field). returnIssue=true : sans lui Jira répond 204 sans corps, que l'étape ApiCall ne sait pas traiter (KT-689).",
    "api_plugin_slug": "mcp-atlassian",
    "api_config_id": "@@jira.config_id@@",
    "api_endpoint_path": "{{steps.jira_cle.data.stdout}}",
    "api_method": "PUT",
    "api_query": {
     "fields": "@@jira.review_version_field@@",
     "returnIssue": "true"
    },
    "api_body": {
     "fields": {
      "@@jira.review_version_field@@": "{{steps.jira_v.data.v}}"
     }
    },
    "_requires": "jira.review_version_field"
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "jira_txt",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "Exec"
    },
    "description": "Le commentaire de traçabilité : version, PR, réponses postées, commit.",
    "exec_command": "python3",
    "exec_args": [
     "-c",
     "@@script:workflows/pr_update.py@@",
     "fix_jira_txt",
     "{{repo}}",
     "{{pr}}",
     "{{run.id}}"
    ],
    "exec_timeout_secs": 60,
    "_requires": "jira.review_version_field"
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "jira_note",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "ApiCall"
    },
    "description": "Le commentaire sur le ticket (REST v2, texte wiki), avec le compte de la connexion Atlassian de Kronn. 0 token.",
    "api_plugin_slug": "mcp-atlassian",
    "api_config_id": "@@jira.config_id@@",
    "api_endpoint_path": "{{steps.jira_cle.data.stdout}}/comment",
    "api_method": "POST",
    "api_query": {},
    "api_body": {
     "body": "{{steps.jira_txt.data.stdout}}\n\n_(depuis Le Bureau)_"
    },
    "_requires": "jira.review_version_field"
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "end",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "Exec"
    },
    "description": "Fin.",
    "exec_command": "python3",
    "exec_args": [
     "-c",
     "@@script:workflows/pr_update.py@@",
     "end",
     "{{repo}}",
     "{{pr}}",
     "{{run.id}}"
    ],
    "exec_timeout_secs": 60,
    "on_result": [
     {
      "contains": "OK",
      "action": {
       "type": "Stop"
      }
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "agent": "ClaudeCode",
    "prompt_template": "",
    "mode": {
     "type": "Normal"
    },
    "output_format": {
     "type": "FreeText"
    },
    "name": "abort",
    "step_type": {
     "type": "Exec"
    },
    "description": "Changements demandés : dossier de travail retiré, rien poussé ni posté.",
    "exec_command": "python3",
    "exec_args": [
     "-c",
     "@@script:workflows/pr_update.py@@",
     "abort",
     "{{repo}}",
     "{{pr}}",
     "{{run.id}}"
    ],
    "exec_timeout_secs": 120
   }
  ],
  "actions": [],
  "safety": {
   "sandbox": false,
   "require_approval": false
  },
  "workspace_config": {
   "hooks": {},
   "require_isolation": false,
   "main_tree_read_only": true
  },
  "concurrency_limit": 1,
  "exec_allowlist": [
   "python3"
  ],
  "concurrency_key": "{{repo}}|{{pr}}",
  "guards": {
   "timeout_seconds": 86400
  }
 }
}
